      "title": "Requisitions",
      "body": "Internal demand starts here as a requisition: what is needed, by when, how urgent, with an estimated value. A requisition moves through submit, approve or reject, and can finally be converted into a purchase order; the approval timeline stays visible on the record. Nothing posts and nothing leaves the workspace: the estimate is a planning figure, not a posted amount.",
